      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE has just refreshed its Fall/Winter 2026 preview collection with new bags, introducing the cutout woven leather Amazona 180, the Puzzle bag in lizard and lambskin patchwork, and the pleated Nappa lambskin Flamenco. The lineup also sees classic silhouettes in new muted mineral tones and deep navy blue, a palette that feels both grounded and serene.",
