      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Amazona 180 takes cues from basket weaving, crafted from fine, supple calfskin strips. The openwork design lends the bag a poetic play of light and shadow. It debuts in white and black in the medium size, plus a fiery orange in the small size. With its single top handle and open top, it exudes a relaxed, refined attitude.",
